<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix F Ablation Study Supplement ‣ DNA-DetectLLM: Unveiling AI-Generated Text via a DNA-Inspired Mutation-Repair Paradigm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> compares the detection performance and inference time of DNA-DetectLLM under different repair orders. The results show that the default setting achieves superior performance compared to alternative strategies, while reducing computation time by nearly 20×, highlighting its practical efficiency.</p>
</div>
